@startuml
title List Hospitals

actor User
participant UI
participant HospitalsController
participant HospitalService
participant HospitalRepository
participant AuthService
participant AutoMapper
database Database

== UI Request ==
User -> UI : 1. Click "View Hospitals" or load hospitals page
activate UI
UI -> HospitalsController : 2. HTTP GET /api/hospitals (HospitalFilterRequest)
activate HospitalsController

== Service Call ==
HospitalsController -> HospitalService : 3. GetFilteredAsync(HospitalFilterRequest)
activate HospitalService

== Query Hospitals ==
HospitalService -> HospitalRepository : 4. GetFilteredAsync(HospitalFilterRequest)
activate HospitalRepository
HospitalRepository -> Database : 5. SELECT * FROM Hospitals\nWHERE (@searchTerm IS NULL OR Name LIKE '%' + @searchTerm + '%')\nAND (@status IS NULL OR Status = @status)\nAND (@location IS NULL OR Location LIKE '%' + @location + '%')\nORDER BY @sortBy @sortOrder\nOFFSET @offset ROWS FETCH NEXT @pageSize ROWS ONLY
activate Database
Database --> HospitalRepository : 6. List<HospitalEntity>
deactivate Database

HospitalRepository -> Database : 7. SELECT COUNT(*) FROM Hospitals\nWHERE (@searchTerm IS NULL OR Name LIKE '%' + @searchTerm + '%')\nAND (@status IS NULL OR Status = @status)\nAND (@location IS NULL OR Location LIKE '%' + @location + '%')
activate Database
Database --> HospitalRepository : 8. TotalCount
deactivate Database
HospitalRepository --> HospitalService : 9. (List<HospitalEntity>, TotalCount)
deactivate HospitalRepository

== Map to DTOs ==
HospitalService -> AutoMapper : 10. Map(List<HospitalEntity> → List<HospitalResponse>)
activate AutoMapper
AutoMapper --> HospitalService : 11. List<HospitalResponse>
deactivate AutoMapper

== Enrich with Account Status ==
HospitalService -> HospitalService : 12. Extract account IDs from hospitals
activate HospitalService
deactivate HospitalService

HospitalService -> AuthService : 13. GetAccountStatusByIdsAsync(accountIds)
activate AuthService
AuthService --> HospitalService : 14. Dictionary<Guid, Status>
deactivate AuthService

HospitalService -> HospitalService : 15. EnrichHospitalsWithStatusAsync(hospitals)
activate HospitalService
deactivate HospitalService

== Set Pagination Info ==
HospitalService -> HospitalService : 16. Set pagination info (Page, PageSize, TotalPages)
activate HospitalService
deactivate HospitalService

HospitalService --> HospitalsController : 17. HospitalListResponse
deactivate HospitalService

HospitalsController --> UI : 18. HTTP 200 OK (HospitalListResponse)
deactivate HospitalsController

UI --> User : 19. Render hospitals list on screen
deactivate UI

@enduml
